  "solution": "The given equation:\n\n8 - 42 + 104 ÷ 13 × 4 = 18\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\n8 − 42 × 104 ÷ 13 + 4\n\n→ 8 − 42 × __**104 ÷ 13**__ + 4\n\n→ 8 − __**42 × 8**__ + 4\n\n→ 8 − 336 + 4\n\n→ -325 ≠ 18.\n\nOption 2) ÷ and −\n\n8 ÷ 42 + 104 − 13 × 4 = 18\n\n→ __**8 ÷ **____**42**__ + 104 − 13 × 4\n\n→ 0.1905 + 104 − __**13 × 4**__\n\n→ 0.19 + 104 − 52\n\n→ 52.19 ≠ 18\n\nOption 3) − and ×\n\n8 × 42 + 104 ÷ 13 − 4 = 18\n\n→ 8 × 42 + __**104 ÷ **____**13**__ − 4\n\n→ __**8 × **____**42**__ + 8 − 4\n\n→ 336 + 8 − 4\n\n→ 340 ≠ 18\n\nOption 4) − and +\n\n8 + 42 − 104 ÷ 13 × 4 = 18\n\n→ 8 + 42 − __**104 ÷ **____**13**__ × 4\n\n→ 8 + 42 − __**8**____** × 4**__\n\n→ 8 + 42 − 32\n\n**→ 18 = 18.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
